# {{ .Name }}

This Substreams extracts data from Monad blockchain transactions and receipts.

## Quick Start

```bash
# Build the substreams
substreams build

# Run the substreams
substreams run substreams.yaml map_my_data -e monad.streamingfast.io:443
```

## Generated Files

- `substreams.yaml`: Substreams manifest
- `proto/mydata.proto`: Protocol buffer definitions
- `src/lib.rs`: Main Rust source code
- `Cargo.toml`: Rust dependencies

## Customization

Modify the `map_my_data` function in `src/lib.rs` to extract the specific data you need from Monad blocks.
